10
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,344
Select the late arrival. It reaches the home at turn
eighty-four, four turns

11
00:01:33,344 --> 00:01:38,688
late. The courier lights up on the map. The receipt
names the bridge

12
00:01:38,688 --> 00:01:40,333
and the simulator events.

13
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,363
Move the lower bridge by one cell. Waiting breaks the
cap in one

14
00:02:09,363 --> 00:02:14,725
direction. On-time deliveries break it in the other.
The passing layout has a

15
00:02:14,725 --> 00:02:15,138
boundary.

16
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:38,371
Save the project and open it again. The brief and the
measurements come

17
00:02:38,371 --> 00:02:44,741
